]] (जामित्रं लग्नात् सप्तमं स्थानम् [[Malli.]]). Note--Some derive the word from जाया, because in astrology, the जामित्र sign indicates the future good-luck of one's wife (जायामित्रम् ?); but the word is obviously connected with the Greek diametron. 
-Comp. 
-वेधः A variety of योग (Astronomical) when the moon is in the 7th house.
